  "identifier": "dimoose",
  "name": "dimoose: Tools to Reshape and Manipulate Dichotomous Keys Used in Taxonomic Identification",
  "description": "Transforms between dichotomous identification keys and a variety of phenotype formats, including feature matrices, and generates interactive dichotomous key wizards. Imports keys from 'FishBase' <https://www.fishbase.se/keys/allkeys.php> and includes PhyloTree Build 17, the human mitochondrial DNA phylogeny (van Oven 2015, <doi:10.1016/j.fsigss.2015.09.155>), as distributed by 'Haplogrep' 3.",
